# C3 "Destroy Dagoth Ur": inside Red Mountain the player takes Sunder from
# Dagoth Vemyn at Vemynal and Keening from the tower at Odrosal, speaks with
# Dagoth Ur and defeats him, then strikes the Heart of Lorkhan with Sunder and
# Keening, wearing Wraithguard, until its enchantment breaks.
# PositionCell stands in for the walks, the console's damageav for the
# fights, AddItem for looting Sunder from Vemyn's body, and the behavior
# graph's own attack events (the console's `sae`) for the player's swings;
# ref FormIDs carry Morrowind.esm's slot 05.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from c3_sunder
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# Dagoth Vemyn guards Sunder in the Hall of Torque.
case c3_sunder
run
player->PositionCell -234 -1223 -297 180 "Vemynal, Hall of Torque"
until 600 GetPCCell "Vemynal, Hall of Torque" == 1
console 05782B3C.damageav health 100000
until 300 "dagoth vemyn"->GetHealth <= 0
run
player->AddItem sunder 1
end

# Keening lies in Odrosal's tower.
case c3_keening
run
player->PositionCell -165 -269 192 0 "Odrosal, Tower"
until 600 GetPCCell "Odrosal, Tower" == 1
take keening
expect player->GetItemCount keening == 1
end

# With all three tools, Dagoth Ur answers the player's questions and then
# accepts the challenge; he falls, and escapes in spirit to the Heart.
case c3_dagoth_ur
run
player->PositionCell 3865 3751 14167 0 "Dagoth Ur, Facility Cavern"
until 600 GetPCCell "Dagoth Ur, Facility Cavern" == 1
talk dagoth_ur_1
ask parting words
choose 1
choose 2
ask final questions
choose 4
choose 2
choose 8
choose 3
choose 12
choose 17
expect GetJournalIndex C3_DestroyDagoth == 5
bye
console 0587AE04.damageav health 100000
until 300 GetDeadCount dagoth_ur_1 >= 1
end

# The Heart of Lorkhan: one blow of Sunder opens it, and five of Keening
# sever its enchantment.
case c3_heart
run
player->Equip wraithguard
player->Equip sunder
player->PositionCell -11 3760 -269 0 "Akulakhan's Chamber"
until 600 GetPCCell "Akulakhan's Chamber" == 1
wait 60
console player.sae WeapEquip
wait 60
console player.sae attackStart
wait 60
run
player->Equip keening
console player.sae attackStart
wait 60
console player.sae attackStart
wait 60
console player.sae attackStart
wait 60
console player.sae attackStart
wait 60
console player.sae attackStart
wait 60
console player.sae attackStart
until 300 HeartDestroyed == 1
end

# Fleeing the chamber past the door detector ends the Blight; Azura then
# appears in the facility cavern and releases the player from the prophecy.
case c3_azura
run
player->PositionCell -224 400 -10 180 "Akulakhan's Chamber"
until 600 GetJournalIndex C3_DestroyDagoth == 20
run
player->PositionCell 4037 5150 14208 0 "Dagoth Ur, Facility Cavern"
until 600 GetPCCell "Dagoth Ur, Facility Cavern" == 1
until 900 GetJournalIndex C3_DestroyDagoth == 50
end
